Chunky for Horizon
==================

This mod is a port of Chunky, a Minecraft world pre-generation tool,
to Horizon. Chunky is:

  Copyright (c) 2019-2026 pop4959 and contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License.
  https://github.com/pop4959/Chunky

The command structure, selection algorithms, shapes, walk patterns,
region status parsing, trim rules, progress math, and message formats
are derived from Chunky's source and specification, which are MIT-licensed.
The original copyright notice above applies to those parts.

This is an unofficial native port for Horizon. It is not made, endorsed,
or supported by pop4959, the Chunky contributors, Mojang, Microsoft, or
the Horizon project.

Horizon is a Rust reimplementation of Minecraft: Java Edition. Minecraft is a
trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. This mod contains no Minecraft code or assets;
it interacts through Horizon's native hooks and the server chunk loading pipeline.
